Grammar

    0 $accept: program $end

    1 program: stmtlist

    2 stmtlist: ε
    3         | stmtlist stmt
    4         | stmtlist error

    5 stmt: SEMICOLON
    6     | asgn SEMICOLON
    7     | print SEMICOLON
    8     | read SEMICOLON
    9     | if
   10     | while
   11     | repeat SEMICOLON
   12     | for
   13     | dowhile
   14     | readstring SEMICOLON
   15     | clearscreen SEMICOLON
   16     | place SEMICOLON
   17     | text SEMICOLON
   18     | switch
   19     | block

   20 block: LETFCURLYBRACKET stmtlist RIGHTCURLYBRACKET

   21 controlSymbol: ε

   22 if: IF controlSymbol cond THEN stmtlist ENDIF
   23   | IF controlSymbol cond THEN stmtlist ELSE stmtlist ENDIF

   24 while: WHILE controlSymbol cond DO stmtlist ENDWHILE

   25 repeat: REPEAT controlSymbol stmtlist UNTIL cond

   26 for: FOR controlSymbol VARIABLE FROM exp TO exp STEP exp DO stmtlist ENDFOR
   27    | FOR controlSymbol VARIABLE FROM exp TO exp DO stmtlist ENDFOR

   28 dowhile: DO controlSymbol LETFCURLYBRACKET stmtlist RIGHTCURLYBRACKET WHILE cond SEMICOLON

   29 switch: SWITCH controlSymbol cond cases ENDSWITCH
   30       | SWITCH controlSymbol cond cases DEFAULT stmtlist ENDSWITCH

   31 cases: CASE controlSymbol exp COLON stmtlist
   32      | cases controlSymbol CASE exp COLON stmtlist

   33 cond: LPAREN exp RPAREN

   34 asgn: VARIABLE ASSIGNMENT exp
   35     | VARIABLE ASSIGNMENT asgn
