   46 print: PRINT exp

   47 read: READ LPAREN VARIABLE RPAREN
   48     | READ LPAREN CONSTANT RPAREN

   49 readstring: READSTRING LPAREN VARIABLE RPAREN
   50           | READSTRING LPAREN CONSTANT RPAREN

   51 clearscreen: CLEARSCREEN
