   53 place: PLACE LPAREN exp COMMA exp RPAREN

   54 text: TEXT COLOR_YELLOW
   55     | TEXT COLOR_BLUE
   56     | RESET_TEXT

   57 exp: NUMBER
   58    | exp PLUS exp
   59    | exp MINUS exp
   60    | exp MULTIPLICATION exp
